 ional & certified guides\n* ‍All camp meals\, cooking equipment and mess
  kits\n* ‍Tents\n* Canoe rentals\n\nSleeping bags and sleep pads can be 
 rented from WU for a small fee.\n\n**Highlights**\n**Silver Peak Summit:**
  The highest point in Killarney\, with sweeping views over the range and o
 ut to Georgian Bay\n**Stargazing:** With some of the darkest skies in Onta
 rio\, the Milky Way is in full view on a clear night\n**Lake Swimming:** C
 ool off in clear water\, or take the canoe out for a closer look at the sh
 oreline\n\n**Event cost: $455+HST (for explorer members) - $70 optional tr
